cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Crypto Accounting Bench"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark measuring whether a language model can reconstruct the complete
  journal entry an organization recorded for a crypto-asset transaction, using
  that organization's own chart of accounts.
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark, please cite the dataset. The paper citation and DOI
  will be added when published.
type: dataset
repository-code: "https://github.com/EntendreFinance/crypto-accounting-benchmark"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/Entendre/Crypto-Accounting-Bench"
authors:
  - name: "Entendre Finance"
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - accounting
  - cryptocurrency
  - financial-reasoning
  - journal-entry-reconstruction
  - large-language-models
